        'en' => [
            'headline' => 'Lucknow Metro east-west corridor tunnelling reaches Aminabad ahead of schedule',
            'card_text' => 'A tunnel boring machine on the Lucknow Metro east-west corridor broke through at the Aminabad station site on Wednesday, about six weeks ahead of schedule. The underground section links Charbagh with the old city. Officials said traffic diversions around Aminabad will be eased in phases from December as surface work winds down.',
            'key_points' => [
